fields.value:
 * This ability is in the {{Spellslot|4|6}}.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** All ability effects are applied immediately despite the visual effects, and cannot be {{M|disjointed}}.

* {{Symbol|Lane Creeps}} {{Symbol|Death}}
** This is considered a {{M|deny}} source, and grants {{M|experience}} to enemy heroes.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Dominated}} units.
** Does not affect on the following units:
*** {{M|Ancient creeps}}.
*** {{M|Creep-heroes}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Mana restore}}: {{Code|CreepCurrent[[Health|HP]] × ({{#var:Sacrifice value2}} + {{#var:Sacrifice basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}
** {{M|Experience}} gain: {{Code|CreepCurrent[[Experience|XP]] × ({{#var:Sacrifice value3}} + {{#var:Sacrifice basic2}} × SelfLvl)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Sacrifice icon0}}
| desc = Sacrifice an allied creep to convert its current health into mana for Lich and give Lich its experience bounty.<br><br>Begins the game on cooldown and with no charges.
}}

